{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen Garden (\u5929\u9009\u82b1\u56ed / \u5929\u9078\u82b1\u5712 / \u3081\u3050\u308a\u306e\u82b1\u5712 ) is a cozy roguelike deck-builder with a gardening twist! Cultivate unique garden and aim for victory before your harvests run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand, Harvest, and Replant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a 3\u00d73 plot and expand your garden tile by tile. Harvest and replant strategically to maximize your yield and maintain the powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/7d7eb81c7606580eab83f8bd9f0d6719.poster.avif?t=1773901459\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/7d7eb81c7606580eab83f8bd9f0d6719.webm?t=1773901459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/7d7eb81c7606580eab83f8bd9f0d6719.mp4?t=1773901459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With endless combinations, no two runs are ever the same! Place over 100 plants, adapt to shifting weather, and bloom your strategy across diverse garden layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/0e55808ec9c807b5c4969c9cb4c74c02.poster.avif?t=1773901459\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/0e55808ec9c807b5c4969c9cb4c74c02.webm?t=1773901459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=